# =========================================================
# Supabase Configuration (Free Tier PostgreSQL)
# =========================================================
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL in supabase/schema.sql in the SQL Editor
# 3. Copy your Project URL & Anon Key from Settings -> API
# =========================================================

